Create(CLSID_WICWmpDecoder)` or `CreateAsync(JpegXrDecoderId)`; `LastWicError` stamps `CreateAsync` / `qi` / `ras` / `unorm` + HRESULT on Overlay `Display:`; not Magick / libjxl |
